## Rules

- Never reproduce secret values (config files, environment); name the key only.
- Confidential pages: {{sensitive}} — never paste them into public issues, PRs or external tools.
- Do not edit generated files: `{{docs_dir}}/reference/*`, `{{docs_dir}}/agent/*`, `{{docs_dir}}/llms.txt`, `{{docs_dir}}/appendices/coverage.md`, generated copies of `{{docs_dir}}/_src/**`. Edit `{{docs_dir}}/_src/` with link tags (those that resolve in this project: {{tag_kinds}}).
- After code changes: `graphify update .` (if built), then the update steps in `AGENTS.md`.
